{"seq":2,"slug":"frequency-and-voltage-control","title":"频率与电压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/frequency-and-voltage-control","wordCount":2751,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"频率与电压控制\">频率与电压控制</h1><p>频率和电压是衡量一张交流电网是否健康的两个独立&quot;生命体征&quot;。频率反映的是全网有功功率的瞬时平衡——发出多少、用掉多少，一旦失衡，所有同步发电机的转速会同时偏移；电压则是局部的、随地点变化的量，反映的是无功功率在某个节点的供需。把这两件事分开理解，是看懂电网运行的第一道门槛：调度员可以让某个变电站电压偏低却不影响远处的频率，但任何一台机组掉闸都会让全网频率在毫秒级同步下跌。本文围绕这两条控制回路展开,讲清它们各自的物理机理、分层控制架构,以及在 2026 年高比例新能源电网下正在发生的范式转变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条解耦的控制回路\">核心概念：两条解耦的控制回路</h2><p>在高压输电网中,有功-频率(P-f)和无功-电压(Q-V)近似解耦,这是分层控制能成立的物理基础。有功失衡改变频率,无功失衡改变电压,二者可以用两套独立的控制器分别治理。</p>\n<p>下图给出两条回路的对照结构,从扰动到各级响应:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  D[扰动: 机组掉闸&lt;br/&gt;或负荷突变] --&gt; P[有功失衡&lt;br/&gt;全网频率偏移]&#10;  D --&gt; Q[无功失衡&lt;br/&gt;节点电压偏移]&#10;  P --&gt; P1[一次调频&lt;br/&gt;调速器/快速频率响应&lt;br/&gt;秒级 自动 就地]&#10;  P1 --&gt; P2[二次调频 AGC&lt;br/&gt;消除稳态偏差&lt;br/&gt;分钟级 集中]&#10;  P2 --&gt; P3[三次调频&lt;br/&gt;经济调度/备用&lt;br/&gt;十分钟级]&#10;  Q --&gt; Q1[一次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;AVR/SVC/STATCOM&lt;br/&gt;就地自动]&#10;  Q1 --&gt; Q2[二次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;区域协调&lt;br/&gt;分钟级]&#10;  Q2 --&gt; Q3[三次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;全网无功优化&lt;br/&gt;调度级]\">flowchart TD\n  D[扰动: 机组掉闸&lt;br/&gt;或负荷突变] --&gt; P[有功失衡&lt;br/&gt;全网频率偏移]\n  D --&gt; Q[无功失衡&lt;br/&gt;节点电压偏移]\n  P --&gt; P1[一次调频&lt;br/&gt;调速器/快速频率响应&lt;br/&gt;秒级 自动 就地]\n  P1 --&gt; P2[二次调频 AGC&lt;br/&gt;消除稳态偏差&lt;br/&gt;分钟级 集中]\n  P2 --&gt; P3[三次调频&lt;br/&gt;经济调度/备用&lt;br/&gt;十分钟级]\n  Q --&gt; Q1[一次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;AVR/SVC/STATCOM&lt;br/&gt;就地自动]\n  Q1 --&gt; Q2[二次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;区域协调&lt;br/&gt;分钟级]\n  Q2 --&gt; Q3[三次电压控制&lt;br/&gt;全网无功优化&lt;br/&gt;调度级]</pre><p>两条回路的时间尺度与控制范围对照如下:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>频率控制 (P-f)</th>\n<th>电压控制 (Q-V)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被控物理量</td>\n<td>系统频率(全网统一)</td>\n<td>节点电压(局部)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失衡来源</td>\n<td>有功功率不平衡</td>\n<td>无功功率不平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次响应执行者</td>\n<td>调速器、储能快速频率响应</td>\n<td>AVR、SVC、STATCOM、电容器组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次响应时间</td>\n<td>毫秒至数秒</td>\n<td>毫秒至秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次响应手段</td>\n<td>AGC 自动发电控制</td>\n<td>区域电压协调控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要通信</td>\n<td>一次不需要,二次需要</td>\n<td>一次不需要,二次需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播特性</td>\n<td>全网瞬时同步</td>\n<td>随电气距离衰减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"频率的物理本质-摆动方程与惯量\">频率的物理本质：摆动方程与惯量</h2><p>频率之所以能反映有功平衡,根源在于同步发电机转子的旋转动能。当发电大于用电,多余功率加速转子,频率上升;反之减速,频率下降。这一关系由摆动方程(swing equation)描述:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2H \\frac{df_{pu}}{dt} = P_m - P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是惯性常数(单位 MW·s/MVA,即额定运行时转子储存的动能折算秒数),<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是机械输入功率,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是电磁输出功率,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{pu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标幺频率。扰动瞬间频率的变化速率(RoCoF,Rate of Change of Frequency)与系统总惯量成反比:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RoCoF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RoCoF} = \\frac{df}{dt} = \\frac{\\Delta P \\cdot f_0}{2 H_{sys} S_{sys}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RoCoF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式解释了 2026 年电网最棘手的问题:风电和光伏经逆变器并网,本身不提供旋转惯量。随着同步机组被新能源替代,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{sys}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降,同样大小的扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 会带来更陡、更深的频率跌落。英国系统运营商 NESO 把这一现象作为运行核心约束之一,在《Operating a Zero Carbon GB Power System in 2025》中专门论证了惯量与故障电流不足下的频率风险(strathprints.strath.ac.uk)。这正是构网型(grid-forming)逆变器与储能快速频率响应被推上前台的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率的三级控制-从就地反应到经济调度\">频率的三级控制：从就地反应到经济调度</h2><p>频率控制按时间尺度分三级,每一级解决不同问题,层层接力。</p>\n<p><strong>一次调频</strong>是就地、自动、无需通信的比例控制。常规机组靠调速器(governor)感知转速偏差按调差率(droop)增减出力;新能源和储能则通过快速频率响应(FFR)实现。它的作用是&quot;止跌&quot;,在数秒内遏制频率继续恶化,但会留下稳态偏差。储能在这一级优势巨大——电池可在 50 毫秒内提供全功率响应,在 1.5 秒内遏制频率下降,并在一分钟内把频率拉回 60 Hz(美国研究案例,见 mdpi.com 黑启动控制策略论文)。中国相关标准对储能一次调频提出了明确量化要求:飞轮储能调频电站的频率死区应控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> Hz 以内,调差率不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span>,稳态误差控制在额定功率的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span> 以内(T/CRES 0015-2023,中国可再生能源学会)。</p>\n<p><strong>二次调频</strong>(AGC,自动发电控制)是集中式的积分控制,目标是消除一次调频留下的稳态偏差,把频率精确拉回额定值,并恢复联络线交换功率。它以区域控制偏差(ACE,Area Control Error)为输入:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ACE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ACE} = (P_{tie} - P_{tie,sched}) + B \\cdot (f - f_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ACE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是频率偏差系数。独立储能凭借调节速率快、精度高,已成为各地 AGC 市场的优质资源——山西已专门出文保障独立储能公平参与二次调频,并设定标准调节速率、标准调节精度与标准响应时间(cnesa.org)。</p>\n<p><strong>三次调频</strong>是分钟级的经济调度与备用安排,由调度根据负荷预测重新分配机组出力点,恢复二次调频的可用容量,本质是把频率控制成本最小化。</p>\n<p>英国的频率响应产品体系是观察这套分层如何市场化的典型样本。NESO 维持系统频率在法定的 49.5–50.5 Hz 之间,并引入三种动态服务——动态调节(DR)、动态缓冲(DM)、动态遏制(DC)——它们都在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.015</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.015</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.015</span></span></span></span></span> Hz 死区内运行;DR 与 DM 在 0.5 秒启动、1 秒满发,对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> Hz 偏差;而 DC 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> Hz 大偏差时满发,用于重大故障后支撑(neso.energy)。这套产品几乎被电池储能主导,印证了储能在毫秒级频率市场的统治地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电压控制-无功的局部博弈\">电压控制：无功的局部博弈</h2><p>电压与频率最大的不同在于它是局部量。无功功率在电网中传输会带来显著的电压损耗,无法像频率那样&quot;全网一个值&quot;,因此电压必须就近平衡、分区治理。</p>\n<p>电压控制同样分三级。<strong>一次电压控制</strong>就地自动:同步机组靠励磁系统的自动电压调节器(AVR)调整无功出力;无功补偿设备如 SVC(静止无功补偿器)、STATCOM(静止同步补偿器)、电容器组提供快速无功支撑。STATCOM 基于电压源换流器,能在高速控制下快速吸收或发出无功(ENTSO-E technopedia)。<strong>二次电压控制</strong>在区域层面协调各无功源,把关键枢纽节点(pilot bus)电压维持在设定值。<strong>三次电压控制</strong>在全网做无功优化潮流,以网损最小或安全裕度最大为目标重新分配无功。</p>\n<p>下面对比几种主流无功支撑设备的特性:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备</th>\n<th>响应速度</th>\n<th>无功类型</th>\n<th>是否连续可调</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并联电容器组</td>\n<td>秒级(分级投切)</td>\n<td>仅容性</td>\n<td>否(离散)</td>\n<td>稳态电压抬升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVR(机组励磁)</td>\n<td>数百毫秒</td>\n<td>容性/感性</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>机端电压调节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SVC</td>\n<td>数十毫秒</td>\n<td>容性/感性</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>动态电压支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STATCOM</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>容性/感性</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>弱电网、暂态支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构网型 STATCOM+储能</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>有功+无功</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高比例新能源弱网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>随着新能源占比攀升,电压控制的范式也在变。传统 STATCOM 多为跟网型(grid-following),需要参考已有电网电压;而带储能的构网型 STATCOM 正在进入市场,它能同时提供有功与无功支撑,在频率电压突变时改善暂态响应。西门子能源已为德国 Amprion 交付带谐波滤波的构网型 STATCOM,为莱茵-内卡地区提供快速灵活的电压支撑(siemens-energy.com)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构网型逆变器-两条回路的重新统一\">构网型逆变器：两条回路的重新统一</h2><p>构网型逆变器的兴起,正在模糊频率控制与电压控制长期分离的边界。它的核心是让电力电子设备像同步发电机一样,自主建立电压幅值与频率,而不再被动跟随电网。</p>\n<p>跟网型与构网型的根本差异在于谁是电压&quot;源&quot;。跟网型逆变器把自己当作受控电流源,必须依赖外部电网提供的电压相位参考,在弱网或孤网中容易失稳;构网型逆变器表现为受控电压源,自主输出电压幅值与频率,因而能在没有同步机的纯逆变器电网中维持稳定。pv magazine 在 2026 年初报道,美国研究者通过实测证实构网型逆变器能显著提升电网稳定性(pv-magazine.com)。构网型设备必须满足几项硬要求:在设备容量内对任意电流提供电压与频率支撑、防止超出设备能力运行、在任意电网拓扑下保持稳定、并在不依赖快速通信的前提下穿越扰动(ENTSO-E)。</p>\n<p>电池储能因响应快、可双向流动、可控性强,被认为是最适合构网控制的载体。这意味着同一台储能逆变器可以同时承担合成惯量、快速频率响应与动态无功支撑——把过去由调速器、AVR、SVC 分别完成的功能整合进一套电力电子控制中。2026 年的专利版图也反映了这一趋势,围绕一次/快速频率响应、紧急频率控制、虚拟/合成惯量与构网型逆变器四大技术域密集布局(PatSnap 2026 frequency stability patent landscape)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>频率是全网同步的有功平衡指标,电压是随地点变化的无功平衡指标</strong>——这是理解电网运行的第一性区分,二者由近似解耦的两套控制回路分别治理。</li>\n<li><strong>频率的物理根基是摆动方程</strong>,RoCoF 与系统惯量成反比;新能源替代同步机导致惯量下降,是 2026 年频率稳定面临的核心挑战。</li>\n<li><strong>频率三级控制</strong>:一次调频就地止跌(储能可 50 ms 响应)、二次调频 AGC 以 ACE 为输入消除稳态偏差、三次调频做经济调度恢复备用。</li>\n<li><strong>电压三级控制</strong>因无功的局部性而必须分区就近治理,从 AVR/电容器到 SVC、STATCOM 再到构网型储能,响应速度与灵活性逐级提升。</li>\n<li><strong>构网型逆变器正在重新统一两条回路</strong>:同一台储能设备可同时提供合成惯量、快速频率响应与动态无功支撑,成为高比例新能源电网的稳定基石。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源:<a href=\"https://www.neso.energy/news/national-grid-eso-debuts-dynamic-containment-frequency-response-service\">NESO 频率响应产品</a>、<a href=\"https://strathprints.strath.ac.uk/74793/3/Brush_etal_2020_Operating_a_zero_carbon_GB_power_system_in_2025_market_needs.pdf\">Operating a Zero Carbon GB Power System in 2025</a>、<a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/01/13/grid-forming-inverters-boost-grid-stability-say-us-researchers/\">pv magazine 构网型逆变器报道</a>、<a href=\"https://www.entsoe.eu/technopedia/techsheets/static-synchronous-compensator-statcom/\">ENTSO-E STATCOM technopedia</a>、<a href=\"https://www.siemens-energy.com/global/en/home/references/svc-plus-rheinau-statcom.html\">西门子能源构网型 STATCOM</a>、<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2313-0105/11/8/296\">MDPI 储能黑启动调频策略</a>、<a href=\"https://www.cnesa.org/information/detail/?column_id=3&amp;id=6465\">CNESA 山西独立储能参与二次调频</a>、<a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/articles/grid-frequency-stability-patent-landscape-2026/\">PatSnap 2026 频率稳定专利版图</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"频率与电压控制","id":"频率与电压控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条解耦的控制回路","id":"核心概念-两条解耦的控制回路"},{"level":2,"text":"频率的物理本质：摆动方程与惯量","id":"频率的物理本质-摆动方程与惯量"},{"level":2,"text":"频率的三级控制：从就地反应到经济调度","id":"频率的三级控制-从就地反应到经济调度"},{"level":2,"text":"电压控制：无功的局部博弈","id":"电压控制-无功的局部博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"构网型逆变器：两条回路的重新统一","id":"构网型逆变器-两条回路的重新统一"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电网架构与运行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-architecture-and-operation"},"next":{"title":"电网平衡与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-balancing-and-dispatch"}}